@baseUrl = https://localhost:7246
@characterId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@antiforgery = replace-with-token-from-identity-antiforgery

### Read the owner's authoritative build
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/build

### Record a choice (copy the offered selection and option identities from GET)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/choices
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":0,"operationId":"ccead3ac-1357-4a65-ab69-88767102b921","selectionId":"srd521:character:default/class","answers":["srd521:class:fighter"]}

### Record a partial input map; the complete standard array comes from GET
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/ability-scores
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":1,"operationId":"d452c77a-bdb4-4561-a7c1-f49824cba0e5","inputs":{"strength":15}}

### Claim a previously selected class package independently
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/equipment-claims
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":2,"operationId":"d411a128-3751-48b0-91b5-130fd8ad1aba","selectionId":"srd521:character:default/class/srd521:class:fighter/equipment"}

### Allocate actual owned item IDs returned by GET
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/equipment
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":3,"operationId":"58df5f9c-95b5-4f18-9bc2-3c6cc7b0faaa","armorId":null,"weaponId":null}

### Rename; replay the identical operationId and payload after a dropped response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/{{characterId}}/name
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedRevision":4,"operationId":"aa2f4157-04aa-45fc-a8af-15ebad4f2d96","name":"Mira"}

### Unknown or another owner's Character returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/characters/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/build
